Current Task: You are gathering internal customer research data from the Dovetail workspace. Focus ONLY on Dovetail. Do NOT use Tavily or competitive intelligence tools. Do NOT synthesize findings.
## PM Input
**Feature / Idea Summary:** A self-service analytics dashboard for e-commerce merchants that shows real-time conversion funnel data, replacing the current static weekly PDF reports.

**Goals:** Reduce merchant support tickets about reporting by 60%. Increase merchant retention by 10% within 6 months of launch.

**User Summary:** Mid-market e-commerce merchants (50-500 employees) who sell physical goods online, primarily using Shopify or WooCommerce. Most are not technical â€” they rely on their ops team to interpret data.

## Your Job
1. **Search Dovetail.** Call the dovetail_research tool with
   action='deep_search' and a keyword query related to the problem
   space (e.g., the core topic from feature_summary). This will
   search the workspace, find relevant projects, and fetch full
   insight content including direct customer quotes.

2. **Run at least two deep_search calls** with different queries.
   For example, one for the core problem domain and one for the
   user persona or a specific pain point.

3. **Extract quotes.** From the returned insight content, pull out
   direct customer quotes with attribution. Include the insight
   title and project name as the source.

4. **Return as CustomerEvidenceOutput JSON.** If Dovetail returns
   no relevant content, populate dovetail_gaps with what was
   searched and what was missing. Do not fabricate quotes.

## Rules
- Only use the dovetail_research tool. No other tools. - Direct quotes go in quotation marks with source attribution. - Never fabricate interview quotes or customer data. - If Dovetail returns nothing useful, say so in dovetail_gaps.


This is the expected criteria for your final answer: A CustomerEvidenceOutput JSON object with customer_evidence populated from real Dovetail insight content (direct quotes with source and theme), dovetail_sources listing the projects and insights referenced, and dovetail_gaps noting any topics where Dovetail had no relevant content.

you MUST return the actual complete content as the final answer, not a summary.
Format your final answer according to the following OpenAPI schema: {
  "description": "Output from the customer evidence task (Dovetail only).\n\nContains direct customer quotes and findings from the Dovetail\nworkspace. Gaps note topics where Dovetail had no relevant content.",
  "properties": {
    "customer_evidence": {
      "description": "Direct quotes and findings from Dovetail workspace",
      "items": {
        "properties": {
          "quote": {
            "title": "Quote",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "source": {
            "description": "e.g., Dovetail, G2 Review, Reddit, analyst report",
            "title": "Source",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "theme": {
            "description": "Which pain point or topic this relates to",
            "title": "Theme",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "attribution": {
            "default": null,
            "description": "Person/role if available",
            "title": "Attribution",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "quote",
          "source",
          "theme",
          "attribution"
        ],
        "title": "CustomerQuote",
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "title": "Customer Evidence",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "dovetail_sources": {
      "description": "Dovetail projects and insights referenced",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Dovetail Sources",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "dovetail_gaps": {
      "description": "Topics the Dovetail search could not cover",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Dovetail Gaps",
      "type": "array"
    }
  },
  "title": "CustomerEvidenceOutput",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "customer_evidence",
    "dovetail_sources",
    "dovetail_gaps"
  ]
}

